WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2, Scene 09h: Lunar Base flyaround and spacewalk
Duration: ~48 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV — Esthar's orbital station, figures drifting in space

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Close-up of the Lunar Base in orbit. A circular ring with red warning lights and ESTHAR markings rotates against the starfield.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Camera pulls back. The station's antenna arms reach into the darkness, stars scattered beyond.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A figure in white drifts near the station's green-lit hull. A second figure floats nearby amid debris.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Two figures in spacesuits float between the station's modules, red lights flashing, green panels visible on the hull.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
A lone white-suited figure drifts between two sections of the station. The gold connecting arm stretches across the frame.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Close-up of the Lunar Base hull. Bronze panels with red trim, the circular ring section turning slowly.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.500
The full Lunar Base recedes. Gold arms extend from the central ring, green-lit windows dotting the hull, ESTHAR marking visible. Stars surround it.
